## Real application data.
## The application creates data/contacts.json automatically on first
## run. It must NEVER be committed, because it may end up containing
## real personal contact information entered during actual use.
## Only the fictional data in examples/sample_contacts.json is
## committed to the repository.
data/*.json
!data/.gitkeep
**/data/contacts.json
